{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You wake up in a dark room. It's only you, your oppressor, and an infernal coining press. The gate behind you looks like a way out, but your freedom will come at a price.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEORUM</strong> is an active\u00a0<strong>incremental</strong> game with a <strong>horror</strong> <strong>lovecraftian</strong>\u00a0theme and narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gather materials</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/d6804e7c345207e65e347727b2adb873.poster.avif?t=1761671842\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/d6804e7c345207e65e347727b2adb873.webm?t=1761671842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/d6804e7c345207e65e347727b2adb873.mp4?t=1761671842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing your pickaxe at shining ores, living flesh, and otherwordly artifacts. Merge materials to acquire even more powerful &quot;ingredients&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Mint coins</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/2735c57dfd6ca68fd87f335883e1ed2c.poster.avif?t=1761671842\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/2735c57dfd6ca68fd87f335883e1ed2c.webm?t=1761671842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/2735c57dfd6ca68fd87f335883e1ed2c.mp4?t=1761671842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft coins of grotesque character. Discover arcane symbols which bestow luck and oppulence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Upgrade your skills</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/8a88083b816533bc0ddd1d4f3d6de7f3.poster.avif?t=1761671842\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/8a88083b816533bc0ddd1d4f3d6de7f3.webm?t=1761671842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/8a88083b816533bc0ddd1d4f3d6de7f3.mp4?t=1761671842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your earnings to improve your odds of crafting valuable coins, unlock new materials, or increase your productivity and endurance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Discover dark secrets</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/fc8ff9fb8fb9e2969422467b2a13859b.poster.avif?t=1761671842\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/fc8ff9fb8fb9e2969422467b2a13859b.webm?t=1761671842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/fc8ff9fb8fb9e2969422467b2a13859b.mp4?t=1761671842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps there's a divine purpose behind this madness?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active Incremental gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple materials and coin symbols to interact with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tree of upgrades and unlocks to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovecraftian narrative and unsettling horror atmosphere\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2+ hours of playtime </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4129040?t=1761671842","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4129040?t=1761671842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/6ea11d5715c7a602428b2b092c4508b5facea91e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761671842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/6ea11d5715c7a602428b2b092c4508b5facea91e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761671842","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"DEORUM contains gore imagery presented in 2D pixel art style.\r\n\r\nGameplay involves interactions with gore elements, such as grabbing and holding severed body parts with cursor."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You wake up in a dark room. It's only you, your oppressor, and an infernal coining press. The gate behind you looks like a way out, but your freedom will come at a price.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEORUM</strong> is an active\u00a0<strong>incremental</strong> game with a <strong>horror</strong> <strong>lovecraftian</strong>\u00a0theme and narrative.</p><h2 cl